            {
                "entry_id": "c72f1e33-1b60-3c08-ae37-0c32d58c9bb9",
                "word": "ha-ha",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "5ebc133e-db20-46ca-94aa-892c8ea77f3c",
                        "entry_id": "c72f1e33-1b60-3c08-ae37-0c32d58c9bb9",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ha-has"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e7a13cf8-8bd3-348e-9ec8-8566ebff77ea",
                        "entry_id": "c72f1e33-1b60-3c08-ae37-0c32d58c9bb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A laugh."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8f581ce0-712c-4392-8614-c08d6de2e38a",
                                "sense_id": "e7a13cf8-8bd3-348e-9ec8-8566ebff77ea",
                                "text": "Ha-has from both sides of the door."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "00dd9cc9-a529-4628-aee9-b01ec471ee13",
                                "sense_id": "e7a13cf8-8bd3-348e-9ec8-8566ebff77ea",
                                "text": "His ha-ha grated on our ears as he fled down the stairs three steps at a time with us in hot pursuit."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63709067-571e-4a1e-b4b8-5bf5379d24e3",
                                "sense_id": "e7a13cf8-8bd3-348e-9ec8-8566ebff77ea",
                                "text": "We had a fine dinner, punctuated with Heidi's loud ha-has and lots of wine."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfe6924d-3b0d-4f5e-8915-4cf265888bb7",
                                "sense_id": "e7a13cf8-8bd3-348e-9ec8-8566ebff77ea",
                                "text": "Not just giggles or a few ha-has, but the paralyzing kind of laughter, when the eyes tear and the nose runs and one gasps seemingly unto apoplexy."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "68a5b78d-9578-3b59-b40d-ac9a09d108df",
                        "entry_id": "c72f1e33-1b60-3c08-ae37-0c32d58c9bb9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something funny; a joke."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8596a391-c97d-4c6f-8318-7f954ff33336",
                                "sense_id": "68a5b78d-9578-3b59-b40d-ac9a09d108df",
                                "text": "Durty Nelly's, […] You'll catch a few ha-has and even a golden memory or two singing along with the house piano player."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "66f93377-adfc-4bc1-b00e-3bed9d0fd46a",
                                "sense_id": "68a5b78d-9578-3b59-b40d-ac9a09d108df",
                                "text": "She is not rewarded until she learns to reduce her expectations, and surprises (the ha-has of this novel) are the educational tool."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b2ef05fe-a3fe-41c6-909b-c097f07c51b9",
                                "sense_id": "68a5b78d-9578-3b59-b40d-ac9a09d108df",
                                "text": "If Kathy had been with us, she'd have countered with a few ha-has of her own, thus guaranteeing a laugh at his expense."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "7bdea396-1ee7-334e-90f9-deec1f3262d0",
                "word": "ha-ha",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "df572643-e378-416f-be41-2c330b088a9d",
                        "entry_id": "7bdea396-1ee7-334e-90f9-deec1f3262d0",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "ha-has"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f25cfcda-008a-3a33-9620-242e4f4fd42e",
                        "entry_id": "7bdea396-1ee7-334e-90f9-deec1f3262d0",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A ditch with one vertical side, acting as a sunken fence, designed to block the entry of animals into lawns and parks without breaking sightlines."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "20206677-b596-42ba-add4-6fe889bfb97f",
                                "sense_id": "f25cfcda-008a-3a33-9620-242e4f4fd42e",
                                "text": "A few steps farther brought them out at the bottom of the very walk they had been talking of; and standing back, well shaded and sheltered, and looking over a ha-ha into the park, was a comfortable-sized bench, on which they all sat down."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef6df687-e1d5-4603-940d-293f734ebcc5",
                                "sense_id": "f25cfcda-008a-3a33-9620-242e4f4fd42e",
                                "text": "This pathway ran up hill, across another open space covered with white incrustation, and plunged into a canebrake again. Then suddenly it turned parallel with the edge of a steep-walled gap, which came without warning, like the ha-ha of an English park,—turned with an unexpected abruptness. I was still running with all my might, and I never saw this drop until I was flying headlong through the air."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3239b2d-36f7-4777-9408-6522f0765d64",
                                "sense_id": "f25cfcda-008a-3a33-9620-242e4f4fd42e",
                                "text": "A moody stroll through the oaks and bracken beyond the ha-ha didn't help."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ce850a01-66af-4574-b208-ac52bdbbb8bf",
                        "source_entry_id": "7bdea396-1ee7-334e-90f9-deec1f3262d0",
                        "source_sense_id": "f25cfcda-008a-3a33-9620-242e4f4fd42e",
                        "source_sense_description": "ditch acting as a sunken fence",
                        "target_lang_word": "haha",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "haha",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f689d6c4-f970-3485-a931-189f0942cd03",
                                        "entry_id": "ba007774-e865-3dc7-b430-ee9e40341b3f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Interjection exprimant la moquerie, le rire, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14a94a52-2655-4491-af67-d6d438cafc33",
                                                "sense_id": "f689d6c4-f970-3485-a931-189f0942cd03",
                                                "text": "Haha ! Évidemment, ce serait un peu maigre. Il faudrait y ajouter une plaque de beurre. Haha !"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "haha",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36b866eb-0240-3b5d-aa18-76029b808a22",
                                        "entry_id": "6e19b17c-f6fd-34f5-8531-3109d5799682",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Discontinuité dans un escalier, une passerelle, ou tout autre ouvrage de communication utilisés dans les fortifications, afin d’empêcher les assaillants de l’emprunter. Il est recouvert par une structure mobile en bois qu’il suffit d’enlever pour retarder l’ennemi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "729fc1a6-4709-4f56-ac5a-c02ce640a34a",
                                                "sense_id": "36b866eb-0240-3b5d-aa18-76029b808a22",
                                                "text": "Le pont levis est un haha."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bd7a362-eba1-3f3e-bb79-9f45e37aabbd",
                                        "entry_id": "6e19b17c-f6fd-34f5-8531-3109d5799682",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Obstacle qui interrompt le chemin que l’on suit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "analogy"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bfd9f5ff-7251-3aea-b800-5e7442cb49cc",
                                        "entry_id": "6e19b17c-f6fd-34f5-8531-3109d5799682",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(Paysagisme) Dénivelé sur un gazon constituant une ligne invisible ouverte sur l’horizon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8efc98e-7c44-4891-941c-7d87aea11048",
                                                "sense_id": "bfd9f5ff-7251-3aea-b800-5e7442cb49cc",
                                                "text": "Paysage élitiste à un double point de vue, de celui qui le veut (le grand seigneur, l’aristocrate notamment) et de celui qui le fait avec tout son savoir-faire et ses artifices paysagistes (saut de loup, perspective, haha, etc.)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d8c053d-1b60-3b7e-bf75-1dbb5b838957",
                                        "entry_id": "6e19b17c-f6fd-34f5-8531-3109d5799682",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ouverture pratiquée dans un mur afin d’ouvrir la vue. Il est doublé d’un fossé nommé saut-de-loup sur sa partie extérieure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b455a935-1c31-3ebd-912a-c732662d49f5",
                                        "entry_id": "6e19b17c-f6fd-34f5-8531-3109d5799682",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Voile placée sous le bout-dehors de beaupré."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "haha",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "88383a2a-c106-37db-958b-60137f788236",
                                        "entry_id": "6fe3f529-6745-39cf-b09a-7e4e9727cdd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vieille femme laide."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
